"# Knowledge\n\nShared knowledge for agents, one folder per subject. Read aos/ first: it explains aos and how to look things up (paths here start with aos/, like aos/errors.json#/codes). wf/ explains how the working documents of a workspace (workflows, knowledge, open items) are organized, and ships ready-made workflow nodes (wf/workflows/_index.json is the dispatch table) and record skeletons; its text is in Traditional Chinese."
